prop=\"ingredients\">&frac12; Teaspoon(s) salt</li> </ul> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"ERSInstructions\"> <div class=\"ERSInstructionsHeader ERSHeading\">Instructions</div> <ol> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">In a small bowl, combine molasses and boiling water; set aside.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">In a large bowl, cream butter, shortening and sugars until light and fluffy. Add eggs. Gradually add molasses mixture.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Combine flour, ginger, cinnamon, baking powder, baking soda and salt; gradually add to creamed mixture.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Transfer to three 5.75x3x2-in loaf pans coated with spray. Bake at 325 for 30 minutes or until a toothpick inserted near the center comes out clean.</li> <li class=\"instruction\" itemprop=\"recipeInstructions\">Cool for 10 minutes before removing from pans to wire racks.</li> </ol> <div class=\"ERSClear\"></div> </div> <div class=\"endeasyrecipe\" title=\"style002\" style=\"display: none\">3.5.3226</div> </div><br />\n </p>\n"
